  <data name="Index_Description" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>Used to manage human resources in manufacturing plants, ensuring effective assignment and scheduling of production line workers.</value>
  </data>
  <data name="Index_Features" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>This system typically includes the following features:</value>
  </data>
  <data name="Index_Feature1" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>1. Personnel Data Management: Records employee basic information, skills, and experience.</value>
  </data>
  <data name="Index_Feature2" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>2. Production Scheduling: Assigns employees to appropriate workstations based on production plans and line requirements.</value>
  </data>
  <data name="Index_Feature3" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>3. Work Progress Tracking: Tracks employee work progress and product flow on the production line.</value>
  </data>
  <data name="Index_Feature4" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>4. Data Analysis and Reporting: Analyzes employee performance and production line efficiency.</value>
  </data>
  <data name="Index_Feature5" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>5. Safety and Monitoring: Monitors the work environment and employee safety on the production line.</value>
  </data>
  <data name="Index_Conclusion" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>Using the production line dispatch system can improve efficiency and product quality while reducing errors and delays.</value>
  </data>
  <data name="Index_SOPTitle" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>Online SOP (Standard Operating Procedure)</value>
  </data>
  <data name="Index_SOPDescription" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>Standard operating procedure documents compiled and managed on a digital platform.</value>
  </data>
  <data name="Index_SOPFeature1" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>Unified Standards: Ensures all employees follow the same operational standards, reducing errors and rework.</value>
  </data>
  <data name="Index_SOPFeature2" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>Simplified Training: New employees can self-learn through online SOPs, speeding up onboarding.</value>
  </data>
  <data name="Index_SOPFeature3" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>Consistency: Ensures consistency in operations, improving work quality.</value>
  </data>
  <data name="Index_SOPFeature4" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>Continuous Improvement: Continuously improves business processes through real-time updates and feedback.</value>
  </data>
  <data name="Index_SOPFeature5" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>Reduced Paper and Printing Costs: Digital documents reduce the need for physical storage and printing.</value>
  </data>
  <data name="Index_SOPFeature6" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>Time Savings: Improves work efficiency, reducing time wasted due to unclear processes or errors.</value>
  </data>
  <data name="Index_SOPFeature7" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>Real-time Updates and Review: Ensures SOPs are consistent with the latest regulations and company policies.</value>
  </data>
  <data name="Index_SOPFeature8" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>Clear Operating Procedures: All employees can easily access operating procedures and understand company processes.</value>
  </data>
